POCRTL_BUILD: %X10000001
VMSDEF_BUILD: %X10000001
INFOUSE built: %X10000001
LIB$GETJPI
JPI$_USERNAME: SS$_NORMAL
  |POC         |, length 12
JPI$_MODE: SS$_NORMAL
  |INTERACTIVE|, length 11
JPI$_PID: SS$_NORMAL
  string of length 8, the value in hex: the same
LIB$GETSYI
SYI$_VERSION: SS$_NORMAL
  |V5.5-2H4|, length 8
SYI$_NODENAME: SS$_NORMAL
  ||, length 0
LIB$GETDVI
DVI$_DEVCLASS of SYS$LOGIN: SS$_NORMAL
  a disk: yes
DVI$_DEVCLASS's string: SS$_NORMAL
  |1|, length 1
LIB$GETQUI
SYS$BATCH's QUI$_QUEUE_NAME: SS$_NORMAL
  value 0  |SYS$BATCH|, length 9
SYS$BATCH's QUI$_JOB_LIMIT: SS$_NORMAL
  value 3  |3|, length 1
SYS$BATCH's QUI$_QUEUE_FLAGS: SS$_NORMAL
  value 3802113  |3802113|, length 7
  a batch queue: yes
QUI$_TRANSLATE_QUEUE of sys$batch: SS$_NORMAL
  value 0  |SYS$BATCH|, length 9
a wildcard walk, three calls
* QUI$_QUEUE_NAME: SS$_NORMAL
  value 0  |SYS$BATCH|, length 9
* QUI$_QUEUE_NAME: JBC$_NOMOREQUE
  value 0  ||, length 0
* QUI$_QUEUE_NAME: SS$_NORMAL
  value 0  |SYS$BATCH|, length 9
a wildcard frozen on its queue
* QUI$_QUEUE_NAME, frozen: SS$_NORMAL
  value 0  |SYS$BATCH|, length 9
* QUI$_JOB_LIMIT, frozen: SS$_NORMAL
  value 3  |3|, length 1
QUI$_CANCEL_OPERATION: SS$_NORMAL
* QUI$_QUEUE_NAME after the cancel: SS$_NORMAL
  value 0  |SYS$BATCH|, length 9
QUI$_CANCEL_OPERATION: SS$_NORMAL
errors
item code 12345: SS$_BADPARAM
JPI$_USERNAME with no string: LIB$_INVARG
JPI$_USERNAME into 2 characters: LIB$_STRTRU
  length 2, PO
NO_SUCH_QUEUE's QUI$_QUEUE_NAME: JBC$_NOSUCHQUE
  value 0  ||, length 0
